{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06399","headline":"双笋歌送李回兼呈刘四 · 李颀","name":"双笋歌送李回兼呈刘四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"并抽新笋色渐绿，迥出空林双碧玉。\n春风解箨雨润根，一枝半叶清露痕。\n爲君当面拂云日，孤生四远何足论。\n再三抱此怅爲别，嵩洛故人与之说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}